@local/dsh-suggested-task README · Suggested Task for DSH：A resident plugin for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) (DSH) that suggests actionable follow-up tasks at the end of each completed turn—just like Claude Desktop's Suggested Tasks—and lets you start any single task or **Start All** at once in isolated Git worktrees (`.agents/worktrees/<branch>`) as independent child sessions.

